I am running 5.1.
Only 3.5beta5 got compiled/run OK on my box. 
Other versions compiled OK but core dump when run.
You can try this script, it does what I need:
#!/bin/ksh

# usage: top_arg.sh [number_of_process] [interfal] [occurance]

counter=0
while [ counter -lt ${3:-2} ]
do
    clear
    echo %CPU "USER        PID   PPID TTY      %MEM S     STARTED       TIME PSR COMMAND"
    ps -e -opcpu= -ouser= -opid= -oppid= -otty= -opmem= -ostate= -ostart= -otime= -opsr= -ocommand= | sort -rn | head -n ${1:-20}
    counter=`expr $counter + 1`
    sleep ${2:-5}
done

Hope it helps.

