Well, just an update. One of my friend suggested me a workaround which
works pretty well.

Here is my updated _defaultRule 

$ cat _defaultRule 

.SUFFIXES : .c

local : $(DELIVER)

$(DELIVER) : $$@.c $(INCLUDE_FILES)

.c : 
        cc -o $@ $@.c

The idea is to have dependency on the target!! 
so, base make works fine with this makefile.

-shiva


