I believe it's defined in the system headers (start in limits.h, but
it looks like the actual value is in /usr/include/sys/syslimits.h, and
it's NGROUPS_MAX).

I don't believe this is a tuneable, so you're stuck -- you would need to change
the header file and recompile any program that depends on it (i.e. OS programs,
so you would need the source code for the OS).  Not something most sites can or
would do.

