So, you have a single rack of multiple NT boxes. That is what Compaq's
"futures" slides looked like at a recent presentation.  The point is to
provide IT services. If NT can provide this with multiple CPUs each having its
own instance, costs less than some fancy VMS thing and has the management
tools to manage those multiple OS instances, then why not ?

